1 0 obj<</Author(Lukaswritesthings)/CreationDate(D:20261101034013+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, General Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Adora & Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora/Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Fluff, Angst, Fluff and Angst, Adora is in Love with Catra \(She-Ra\), catra kinda fucking hates her actually, One-Sided Attraction, One-Sided Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Dubious Morality, glimmers a little snotty and stubborn, Glimmer is a Good Friend \(She-Ra\), though, Jealous Glimmer \(She-Ra\), just a bit, A tease, Hurt Adora \(She-Ra\), Adora Needs a Hug \(She-Ra\), Love Confessions, Confessions, Drinking, i can't resist making adora an alcoholic, Drinking to Cope, Heavy Drinking, glimmer drinks too but she's basically taking a shot every time adora finishes her glass, POV Adora \(She-Ra\), Lesbian Adora \(She-Ra\), Lesbian Disaster Adora \(She-Ra\), Canon Lesbian Character, Lesbian Character, Bisexual Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Mentioned Catra \(She-Ra\), okay you get glimbow and glimmadora and catradora as a treat, Dialogue Heavy, glimmer is in love with adora and bow but she does NOT wanna unpack that, all my fics are practically a skewed story of love atp, Love, Falling In Love, technically this has fluff, but its mainly angst, Implied/Referenced Child Abuse, Childhood Friends, adora isn't the most reliable narrator cause im a sucker for conflicting memories, glimmers such a lightweight, F/F, Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings, lonnie is a bully, i actually birthed rogelio and kyle they are mine, \(im a man\), okay catra doesnt hate her shes just complicated, Foreshadowing, slight foreshadowing hidden in one singular line, okay i gotta say this as a preface: lonnie is my favorite character from the squad, i gave birth to kyle a rogelio but i took in lonnie against her will, Adora is in Love with Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Sex, Drunken Confessions, Drunken Kissing, technically dubcon cause they're both drunk but in the moment, but its not meant to be bad, swear, Lesbian Sex, Drunk Sex, glimmer initiates and adora just kinda follows along because she loves her in a way, fades out before the actual smut bc i dont wanna write it, Intimacy)/ModDate(D:20261101034013+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(anchorage)>>
