<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">anchorage</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;"I mean, Catra was my friend, you know? Like, probably the only one I had." She gently reaches out to take the bottle back, making brief eye contact as her fingers graze Glimmer's. The woman huffs with surprise, her grip slackening as she lets Adora take it. With a swig, the blonde speaks again. "I couldn't imagine hurting her when we first met. I couldn't imagine any of this."&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A sudden curiosity reaches it's way into Glimmer's eyes, sparkling with intensity. "When did you guys meet anyways? You've mentioned you and her have a history, but how far back does it go?"&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;or; adora gives glimmer the rundown of how she and catra met over a bottle of stolen whiskey, inadvertently confessing her feelings about the magi-cat. glimmer takes this about as well as you'd expect her to. adora responds in kind.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Lukaswritesthings</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>General Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff and Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora is in Love with Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>catra kinda fucking hates her actually</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>One-Sided Attraction</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>One-Sided Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Dubious Morality</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>glimmers a little snotty and stubborn</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer is a Good Friend (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>though</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Jealous Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>just a bit</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>A tease</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hurt Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora Needs a Hug (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Love Confessions</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Confessions</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Drinking</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i can't resist making adora an alcoholic</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Drinking to Cope</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Heavy Drinking</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>glimmer drinks too but she's basically taking a shot every time adora finishes her glass</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>POV Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lesbian Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lesbian Disaster Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
