          <rdf:li>Mentioned Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>okay you get glimbow and glimmadora and catradora as a treat</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Dialogue Heavy</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>glimmer is in love with adora and bow but she does NOT wanna unpack that</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>all my fics are practically a skewed story of love atp</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Love</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Falling In Love</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>technically this has fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>but its mainly angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied/Referenced Child Abuse</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Childhood Friends</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora isn't the most reliable narrator cause im a sucker for conflicting memories</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>glimmers such a lightweight</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>lonnie is a bully</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i actually birthed rogelio and kyle they are mine</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>(im a man)</rdf:li>
