          <rdf:li>Foreshadowing</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>slight foreshadowing hidden in one singular line</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>okay i gotta say this as a preface: lonnie is my favorite character from the squad</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i gave birth to kyle a rogelio but i took in lonnie against her will</rdf:li>
